1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,870
Hello everyone.

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:10,200
My name's Megan Baker and I'm a recruitment consultant at AVT Recruitment specialists.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:17,628
Now, our company specialises in positions that involve working in the agriculture and horticulture sectors,

4
00:00:17,628 --> 00:00:23,570
so that's fresh food production, garden and park maintenance and so on.

5
00:00:23,570 --> 00:00:28,710
And these sectors do provide some very special career opportunities.

6
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:32,420
For a start, they often offer opportunities for those

7
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:36,027
who don't want to be stuck with a 40-hour week,

8
00:00:36,027 --> 00:00:40,649
but need to juggle work with other responsibilities such as child care -

9
00:00:40,649 --> 00:00:44,500
and this is very important for many of our recruits.

10
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:48,119
Some people like working in a rural setting,

11
00:00:48,119 --> 00:00:54,000
surrounded by plants and trees instead of buildings, although we can't guarantee that.

12
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,254
But there are certainly health benefits,

13
00:00:56,254 --> 00:01:01,100
especially in jobs where you're not sitting all day looking at a screen

14
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,390
a big plus for many people.

15
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:09,570
Salaries can sometimes be good too, although there's a lot of variety here.

16
00:01:09,570 --> 00:01:14,818
And you may have the opportunity in some types of jobs for travel overseas,

17
00:01:14,818 --> 00:01:20,440
although that obviously depends on the job, and not everyone is keen to do it.

18
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:25,390
Of course, working outdoors does have its challenges.

19
00:01:25,390 --> 00:01:31,400
It's fine in summer, but can be extremely unpleasant when it's cold and windy.

20
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:35,082
You may need to be pretty fit for some jobs,

21
00:01:35,082 --> 00:01:39,500
though with modern technology that's not as important as it once was.

22
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:45,193
And standards of health and safety are much higher now than they used to be,

23
00:01:45,193 --> 00:01:47,470
so there are fewer work-related accidents.

24
00:01:47,470 --> 00:01:53,110
But if you like a lively city environment surrounded by lots of people,

25
00:01:53,110 --> 00:01:58,750
these jobs are probably not for you - they're often in pretty remote areas.

26
00:01:58,750 --> 00:02:05,124
And some people worry about finding a suitable place to live,

27
00:02:05,124 --> 00:02:10,340
but in our experience, this usually turns out fine.

28
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:17,270
Now let me tell you about some of the exciting jobs that we have on our books right now.

29
00:02:17,270 --> 00:02:21,240
One is for a fresh food commercial manager.

30
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:25,670
Our client here is a very large fresh food producer

31
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:28,530
supplying a range of top supermarkets.

32
00:02:28,530 --> 00:02:33,690
They operate in a very fast-paced environment with low profit margins

33
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:35,008
the staff there work hard,

34
00:02:35,008 --> 00:02:41,890
but they play hard as well, so if you've a sociable personality this may be for you.

35
00:02:41,890 --> 00:02:50,141
We have an exciting post as an agronomist advising farmers on issues such as crop nutrition,

36
00:02:50,141 --> 00:02:53,530
protection against pests, and the latest legislation

37
00:02:53,790 --> 00:02:56,330
on farming and agricultural practices.

38
00:02:56,330 --> 00:03:03,136
There are good opportunities for the right person to quickly make their way up the career ladder,

39
00:03:03,136 --> 00:03:07,940
but a deep knowledge of the agricultural sector is expected of applicants.

40
00:03:07,940 --> 00:03:12,951
A leading supermarket is looking for a fresh produce buyer

41
00:03:12,951 --> 00:03:17,460
who is available for a 12-month maternity cover contract.

42
00:03:17,460 --> 00:03:20,858
You need to have experience in administration,

43
00:03:20,858 --> 00:03:24,650
planning and buying in the fresh produce industry

44
00:03:25,230 --> 00:03:29,110
and in return will receive a very competitive salary.

45
00:03:29,110 --> 00:03:35,730
We have also received a request for a sales manager for a chain of garden centres.

46
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:42,870
You will be visiting centres in the region to ensure their high levels of customer service are maintained.

47
00:03:42,870 --> 00:03:48,030
This post is only suitable for someone who is prepared to live in the region.

48
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:56,860
There is also a vacancy for a tree technician to carry out tree cutting, forestry and conservation work.

49
00:03:56,860 --> 00:04:03,880
Candidates must have a clean driving licence and have training in safety procedures.

50
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,358
A year's experience would be preferred

51
00:04:06,358 --> 00:04:10,390
but the company might be prepared to consider someone

52
00:04:10,390 --> 00:04:13,380
who has just completed an appropriate training course.

53
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:17,940
Finally, we have a position for a farm worker.

54
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:25,124
This will involve a wide range of farm duties including crop sowing and harvesting,

55
00:04:25,124 --> 00:04:27,690
machine maintenance and animal care.

56
00:04:27,690 --> 00:04:33,560
Perks of the job include the possibility of renting a small cottage on the estate,

57
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:36,690
and the chance to earn a competitive salary.

58
00:04:36,690 --> 00:04:43,000
A driving licence and tractor driving experience are essential.
